WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Reconstructed floors, shown together, then a closer view of one sequence.

00:04.000 --> 00:12.500
A fly-through follows the predicted path inside the reconstruction.

00:12.500 --> 00:19.000
Virtual-rig consistency identifies and corrects an inconsistent view.

00:19.000 --> 00:27.000
Four directional views match across two revisited panoramic captures.

00:27.000 --> 00:38.500
An accelerated fly-through shows a long underground reconstruction.

00:38.500 --> 00:41.000
RIGOR: Rig-Informed Geometry for Omnidirectional Reconstruction.
